OL,3,GNEWSAChildhood dementia needs
OL,4,Arecognition, family says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Health and Social
OL,7,FCare (DHSC) said it was "working hard
OL,8,Fto find new ways to slow down the
OL,9,Fprogress of dementia, speed up
OL,10,Fdiagnosis and improve our understanding
OL,11,Fof the disease".
